            "desc": "Zonal NGO for Sustainable Development is a non-governmental organization based in Chad. Founded by experts in sustainable development, our mission is to drive positive change in communities through concrete and sustainable initiatives. Since our creation, we have developed recognized expertise in local governance, environmental protection, rural development, education, access to drinking water and disaster management.",
